OL,3,ATrump ousts Kimberly Guilfoyle as US
OL,4,Aambassador to Greece after corruption
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump's administration
OL,8,Fhas asked Kimberly Guilfoyle to resign
OL,9,Ffrom her position as US ambassador to
OL,10,FGreece, White House press secretary
OL,11,FKatie Zacharia has announced.
OL,13,FGuilfoyle, a former Fox News host, had
OL,14,Fbeen facing mounting scrutiny after
OL,15,Freports she allegedly asked a Trump
OL,16,Fdonor to pay her hefty credit card bill
OL,17,Fin exchange for access to his
OL,18,Fadministration and behaving
OL,19,Finappropriately while in Athens.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
