OL,3,ATrump ousts Kimberly Guilfoyle as US
OL,4,Aambassador to Greece after corruption
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump said she had done a good job, but
OL,8,Fshe will "not be there" in Greece any
OL,9,Flonger. "I didn't like what I read," he
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FGuilfoyle vowed to defend herself
OL,13,Fagainst the "false" claims and said the
OL,14,Fambassadorship had been the "honour of
OL,15,Fa lifetime".
